{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600020","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:4:1260002001:1":{"text":"ルカが間に入っても、ブラッディ・マリーとギャングたちはまだ相手を睨みつけ、罵声の応酬を続けている……","source_cn":"即使被拉开，血薇帮与水鬼帮的帮派成员还在彼此怒目而视，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA34684FBF26C83B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1260002002:1":{"text":"邪魔すんな！今日こそはピンクのオウムどもを懲らしめてやる！","source_cn":"别拦着我，我要给这帮粉毛鹦鹉一点颜色看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F21E7A3CF735120","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1260002003:1":{"text":"まあまあ、ブラッディ・マリーの若頭が来てるんだ、あんま恥をかかせんなよ。","source_cn":"行了，人家血薇帮的老大都来了，给他们点面子吧——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6E8EF2ADAFC42F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1260002004:1":{"text":"はぁっ！？誰が誰に恥をかかせるって！？","source_cn":"什么？！老子用得到你们给面子？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BEAA60452918724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1260002005:1":{"text":"また一触即発の雰囲気になったと思った矢先、あたりに鋭い声が響いた。","source_cn":"眼看着争执又有升级的势头，一个有力的声音响了起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4CB16CDA9514681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","