n":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1260002036:1":{"text":"ごほんっ！この前乗った船には、世界各地から船乗りが集まってて、小競り合いが絶えなかったんだ。でも――","source_cn":"咳咳——那我就说了。我这次出海，船上都是天南海北来的各...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEAB3EEA2237728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1260002037:1":{"text":"俺が宴会を開いて、みんなで飲み食いする場を何度か設けたら、お互い打ち解けて、船の雰囲気もだいぶ和んだんぜ。","source_cn":"后来我组织了几次酒会，大家一起喝酒聊天，又玩又闹，等到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34BFF849340E960A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1260002038:1":{"text":"どうせ今は急を要することもないし、金にも余裕があるんだろ？だったら、みんなを呼んで、ぱーっと盛り上がるのはどうだ？","source_cn":"你们现在也没什么要紧事，手头也宽裕，趁机组织个什么活动...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3DF62A3069F2EC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1260002039:1":{"text":"たとえわだかまりは解けなくても、ストレス発散になるし、ケンカするよりはいいだろ？","source_cn":"就算没法冰释前嫌，好歹能发泄点多余的精力，省得一天到晚打架。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5C6E07EC34D15B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1260002040:1":{"text":"……ほう、旅に出て、少しは成長したようだな。","source_cn":"……你小子，出了几天船，居然开始有模有样了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBF6A3E447F41F6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","do