"0xBBF69626F477D136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1260002047:1":{"text":"ふと、聞き覚えのある野太い声が聞こえた。","source_cn":"这时，一个熟悉的粗犷嗓音响了起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F56ED1F12A3D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1260002048:1":{"text":"理由なら、秋夜の祭典がもってこいだろう！","source_cn":"理由？马上就是秋夜节了，还有比这个更好的理由？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF972F744314FC22B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1260002049:1":{"text":"よっほほほ！せっかくの祝日なんだ。伝統に触れ、絆を深め合う、まさに一石二鳥じゃないか！","source_cn":"嚯哈哈哈，难得的大节日，又能恢复传统，又能联欢，不是一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FC6BC2D16169E45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1260002050:0":{"text":"そういえば、ここに来てから何年も経つが、一度も<style=\"highlight\">秋夜の祭典</style>が開かれたことはなかったな。たまには戦いだけじゃなく、伝統も重んじたらどうだ？","source_cn":"说起来，我来锈锚港这几年，都没见过你们筹办<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE72E59C8EA30C3B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:63:1260002050":{"text":"そういえば、ここに来てから何年も経つが、一度も<style=\"highlight\">秋夜の祭典</style>が開かれたことはなかったな。たまには戦いだけじゃなく、伝統も重んじたらどうだ？","source_cn":"说